        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present 59B Cromwellsfort Road\r\nCromwellsfort Road is a mature, tree-lined residential address renowned for its welcoming community atmosphere and excellent local amenities. Residents enjoy easy access to a superb selection of schools, parks, cafés, and shopping facilities, all within walking distance. The area is exceptionally well connected, with regular public transport links and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and the M50. Combining a peaceful suburban setting with outstanding convenience, Cromwellsfort Road remains one of South Dublin’s most sought-after locations. \r\nThis charming detached family home offers purchasers the opportunity to own a property in a quiet residential setting while its location offers great convenience, providing quick and easy access to the city centre and an array of amenities just a stone's throw away. \r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed by a generous entrance hall off which you will find a downstairs WC and a sunny kitchen leading onto a separate utility room.  Further to this there is a spacious, dual aspect, open plan living/dining room with french doors leading onto the sunny private garden.\r\nOn the first floor you will find two generously sized bedrooms, the first floor also houses a shower room and separate WC.\r\nCombining bright and well proportioned accommodation with a superb location 59b Cromwellsfort Road provides a rare opportunity for families, first time buyers and investors alike to purchase in this much sought after location.  Early viewing is highly recommended to experience everything this property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nDetached Property\r\nPrivate Garden\r\nSuperb Location\r\nTurnkey Condition"
      },
